<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30022" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγύθεν</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγγύς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>from nigh at hand</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ.
			ἐλθεῖν</span> to <i>approach</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.72
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. σκοπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					467
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				289d
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> with
			Verbs of rest, <i>hard by</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἱσταμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.508
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. εἰσίν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.279
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. dat.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινί</span>
			<i>hard by</i> him, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.554
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ φόνος ἐ. αὐτῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.133
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				19.409
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. Ἀρήνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.723
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θνῄσκοντος ἐ. παρών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					852
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> of kinship,
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.205
			</span></i>.</div>
